VaultRegistry::removeVault(address)
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when vault is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert with VaultRegistryZeroAddress
│   ├── when vault is not registered
│   │   └── it should revert with VaultRegistryVaultDoesNotExist
│   └── when vault is registered
│       ├── it should remove vault from the list
│       ├── it should emit VaultRemoved(vault)
│       └── it should make isVault(vault) return false
